Since $K_{\gamma_o}(\mathbf o) :=  \sum_{j=1}^r\binom{r}{j}(-1)^{1-j} \frac{1}{j^{d_o}\gamma_o^{d_o}}\left(\frac{2}{\pi}\right)^{\frac{d}{2}}  \exp( -2 j^{-2} \gamma_o^{-2} \|\mathbf o\|_2^2)$, so we have 
