    &\stackrel{(d)}{\leq} \|q - \Tilde{q}\|_{L^1(\mathbb{R}^{d_x})}^2 \zeta^{-\frac{1}{2}d_x} 2^{\frac{\mathfrak{K}\underline{s}d_o}{s_o}}2^{\frac{\mathfrak{K}\underline{s}d_x}{s_x}} \|M_{0,\boldsymbol{-\frac{\mathfrak{m}}{2}}}\|_{L^2(\mathbb{R}^{d_x})}^2 \label{eq: b_upper_bound}
